WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>Sohoku High School</b>

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.830
Princess, princess, princess.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.890
I love, love, love you.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.530
I'd better do my best.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.910
Starting today, I'm a second-year.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.780
Princess, princess. Twinkle, twinkle.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.750
As long as I have you and all my friends...

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.170
<b>Chiba Prefecture, Sohoku High School
Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.170
For a while there I was worried 
what was going to happen.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.570
You had a sweltering 38-degree 
fever on the day of the exam.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.720
You had your backup private school,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:35.590
but I believed that you 
would pass spectacularly...

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.680
my brother, Sadatoki!

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.720
Yeah, Bro.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.710
Don't cry, Sadatoki. Congratulations.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.570
Yeah.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.770
Long live the Sugimoto family!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.010
Now we can ride together.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:51.940
That's right. At the Inter-High, too.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.050
The Inter...

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:54.780
Really?

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.710
What? Uh, yeah.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.620
You should always aim high.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.670
Yeah.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.970
I should get going, Bro.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>You'll make it... as long as 
you believe and work hard.</i>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:21.210
<i>Honestly, I think it'll be difficult.</i>

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.250
<i>But I'll do it.</i>

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.410
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:02:55.540 --> 00:03:00.050
<i>RIDE.09  New Sohoku, Start!</i>

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:02.530
<b>Congratulations Bicycle Racing Club, Inter-High Champions
Congratulations Onoda Sakamichi, General Classification Champion</b>

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:11.150
I'll make national champions Sohoku's 
bicycle club stronger by joining it.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.630
Right, Danchiku?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:15.630
I...

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.420
What? Did you say something?

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.040
Sorry.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.390
I'm nervous about my first day of high school 
and can't think of anything to say.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.010
Where's the bathroom?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.150
Hey, the school building's that way!

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.890
They showed us during the new student tour!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.630
I heard a bicycle.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.690
They're coming from the rear gate.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.740
A bicycle racing helmet.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:47.030
And those round glasses. That's...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.990
Princess, princess, princess.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.880
I love, love, love you.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:51.350
A mommy bike, huh?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.550
Princess, princess. Twinkle, twinkle.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.460
That's all? He scared me for nothing.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:58.750
As long as I have you and all 
my friends, I'm invincible.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.380
He's singing a strange song.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.840
<b>Congratulations Bicycle Racing Club, Inter-High Champions
Congratulations Onoda Sakamichi, General Classification Champion</b>

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.630
A banner? With my name on it?

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.500
There we go.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:16.560
Since you were surprised 
to see that banner...

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.280
Does that make you a first-year?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.090
What?

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:26.780
That's the name of cycling superstar 
and Sohoku second-year Onoda-senpai.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:31.580
If you've got the guts to wear that helmet,
you should remember his name.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.290
He's the one who won the Inter-High.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.020
The characters are so big...

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:36.420
Right!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:40.550
He is a huge man. His scale, that is.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.070
And I will surpass him.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.620
The Kimanyu I got yesterday!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.060
Hey! Listen to me, mommy bike boy!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.980
<i>He rode up this slope on a mommy bike?</i>

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.870
G-Good morning.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.230
He's here.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.740
Good morning, Onoda-kun.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.530
Did you see the banners?

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.260
Amazing, aren't they?

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:14.330
Let's all take a picture in front 
of them together later.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.980
With you in the middle.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:16.830
Huh? What?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.210
Oh, no, no, no...

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.550
Are you nervous about being in a new class?

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.090
Pull yourself together. 
You're a national champion.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.010
No, no, no...

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.010
You should take the picture.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:29.680
Imaizumi-kun...

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:32.470
Chances like that don't come along often.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:37.480
<i>Imaizumi-kun's in my new second-year class.</i>

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:42.980
Okay, then. Maybe I'll 
take one if you say so.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.990
Hold up, hold up!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.210
Aren't you guys forgetting someone?

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.700
The flashiest and most important man!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.320
You can't take a photo without me.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.500
Naruko-kun?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:02.170
The genius Speedman of Naniwa, 
Naruko Shoukichi of Class 2-3.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:08.510
I asked the teachers to 
put us in the same class.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.140
But it was a near miss. I'm in Class 3.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.970
Did you really do that?

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.800
What do you think of my hair?

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.780
I wanted to look like a 
bullet shooting forward.

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:19.780
Cool, right? Flashy, right?

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.380
It's the new Naruko.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.650
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.650
It's back to normal!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.410
Before you started wasting time on your hair,

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.870
were you doing what you have to do?

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:40.330
Don't think I came back from 
Osaka unscathed that day.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:46.960
<i>Since the day he returned from riding 
in some kind of race in Osaka...</i>

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.890
<i>Even I can tell Naruko-kun's focus</i>

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.760
<i>during practice has changed.</i>

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.410
<i>Tremendously so.</i>

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.330
I'll show you just how much of a genius I am.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.480
You just wait for the real 
new Naruko Shoukichi.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.730
It's still in development.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:09.790
And when it's finished, 
it'll scare the crap out of you.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:16.830
Really? Will your development be finished 
in time for the summer's Inter-High?

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.360
Oh, easily.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.120
Although if it were you,
it'd probably take until winter.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:25.030
Those two sure are close.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:25.590
I know.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.210
No, we're not!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:31.970
<b>Sohoku
Bicycle
Racing
 Club</b>

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:44.090
We first knocked on the door to 
this room exactly two years ago.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.690
Time has passed, and we're now seniors.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:54.170
We'll welcome new first-years to 
the team and make it even stronger.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.670
Honestly, it'll be a difficult year.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:06.920
But we have to do it for the sake of 
what the upperclassmen left behind.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.960
Every day, every second, is a battle.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:15.050
We'll build ourselves up all 
to win at the Inter-High.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:20.330
But there will be times 
when we're discouraged.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.250
We won't be able to talk to our juniors.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.060
When that happens...

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.150
Let's return to our roots.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.900
<i>This glove...</i>

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.200
<b>Certain</b>

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.200
Aoyagi!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.360
<b>Victory</b>

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.360
Junta!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.010
As long as we're together, 
there's nothing we can't do!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.470
Let's go, Aoyagi!

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.700
Got it, Junta!

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:47.130
<b>Club Application</b>

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.130
I'm Kaburagi Issa. This is Danchiku Ryuhou.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.670
On our first day of school, 
we'd like to join the club.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:55.000
You're new recruits numbers one and two.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.530
As you can see, he's nervous.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.510
N-Nice to meet you.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:06.650
You must be really nervous. 
You're leaning slightly.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.310
I have a request.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.130
What is it?

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:18.600
We got a lot in just three days.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.410
Could you pass me that envelope?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.410
<b>Club Application
Class 1-1, Sugimoto Sadatoki</b>

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.870
Sugimoto's brother submitted 
an application, too.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.340
Thanks.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.090
<b>1) Onoda Sakamichi
2) Imaizumi Shunsuke
3) Naruko Shoukichi
4) Aoyagi Hajime
5) Teshima Junta</b>

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:30.090
Who'll be sixth on the Inter-High team?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.460
We'll see.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:40.640
Looks like you're doing as you were told.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:44.350
Ten minutes before class, 
20 minutes at lunch.

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.050
It's pretty different, isn't it?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.270
Your muscles will remember 
what the burden feels like.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.680
Rather than practicing with a heavy load,

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.280
you'll learn more through frequent practice.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.780
That's your style, Sugimoto.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.940
Thank you, Imaizumi.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:09.040
Since I'm an experienced rider,
I knew I couldn't go easy on myself.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.290
I'm just giving you hints.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.180
You're the one who has to do it.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.670
You don't need to thank me.

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:19.620
I was surprised when you came to me at the 
end of last year and begged me to teach

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.350
you how to become stronger, though.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.350
I'm serious about this.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:30.270
I saw what Onoda did at the Inter-High and 
how everyone in the team believes in him.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.730
Even when they were battered, 
they never gave up.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:37.700
Anyone would be inspired by that.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.230
After all, I'm still a 
member of the Sohoku team.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.490
That side of you is still annoying.

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.920
Besides, my brother is joining the team.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:52.500
I want to stay ahead of him. 
I can't let him beat me.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.510
I should be a role model for him.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.060
Imaizumi...

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:05.010
What do you think?
Have I gotten any stronger?

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.910
You haven't noticed?

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:11.400
You are getting stronger, one step at a time.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:20.610
Line up! This year's goal 
is a repeat championship!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:21.660
Yes, sir!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.370
We'll be setting our sights 
on this summer's Inter-High!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:28.510
If you want to become a 
regular, first-years, rise up!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.160
We'll give chances to the strong!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:31.120
Yes, sir!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.880
<b>Japan National Interscholastic Athletic Meet
Inter-High Road Race
Boys' Competition Champion</b>

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.300
Don't forget! Carve it into your hearts!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.700
We are champions!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.170
Yes, sir!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.550
<i>For three weeks,</i>

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:44.800
<i>the first-years will practice by themselves.</i>

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.060
<i>Whether or not you'll be chosen to join 
our practice will depend on the results</i>

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.830
<i>of the first-year race three weeks from now.</i>

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.380
<b>Three Weeks Later</b>

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.810
Kanzaki-san.

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.620
Hey, Teshima.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.580
We appreciate you helping us again this year.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.910
This time of year has 
rolled around again, huh?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.580
They all look so nervous.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.630
Any interesting guys?

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.460
Yes, a few.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.170
Teshima-san...

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.510
I'd like to talk to you.

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.480
I'll do better than third place this year.

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.150
I want to become stronger, too.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:33.680
Let me ride in the first-year race.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.750
The first-year race will start in 20 minutes.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.940
Has everyone memorized the course?

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:42.820
Yes, sir!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.460
There are a lot of traffic 
signals in the city stage.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.920
Ride carefully.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.070
Yes, sir!

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:50.710
I'm so nervous, I think I'm 
going to forget the course.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:52.610
Huh? Where's my helmet?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:55.210
It must be in the club room. 
There was one in there.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:57.200
<i>The first-year race is about to start.</i>

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:02.370
<i>I'm not going to be riding, 
but I can sense how nervous they all are.</i>

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.780
<i>I'm anxious to watch them, too.</i>

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.260
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.600
Starting tomorrow,
we're second-years, Onoda-kun.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.590
Huh?

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:17.400
Since we practiced over spring break, 
there isn't really a clear distinction.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.320
But tomorrow is the opening ceremony. 
We'll become second-years.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.330
Yeah.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:26.070
Even though nothing seems to have 
changed, we'll have juniors.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.660
Some of our seniors have left, too.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:31.420
Yeah.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.400
We can't stay on the bottom forever.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.710
We'll have to look after 
them and lift them up.

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:42.020
We'll have to cheer them up 
when they're feeling down,

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.300
and praise them when they do well.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.250
Just like our seniors did for us.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:55.020
Oh, right. Onoda-kun, this is your first 
time being a second-year in a club, right?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:55.960
Yeah.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:57.940
Then let me tell you something.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.360
I was in a club during middle school, too.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:07.390
Even though you can thank your seniors,
you can't do for them what they did for you.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:12.720
So pass on their kindness to your juniors.

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.740
<i>My juniors...</i>

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.330
That's how your feelings pass 
from one guy to another.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.370
<i>To my juniors.</i>

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:32.260
<i>D-Despite what he said, during the three 
weeks leading up to the first-year race...</i>

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.280
Are you a first-year?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.980
I'm second-year Onoda.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.110
If there's anything you don't know, just ask.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:44.760
You! Just ask!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.200
Oh, no! Did we make him mad?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:55.450
<i>I failed to act like a senior!</i>

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:59.030
<i>Naruko-kun's talking smoothly 
with the first-years.</i>

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.050
<i>I have to do something.</i>

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:06.300
<i>I know. Their backs.</i>

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.020
<i>I can energize them by 
slapping them on the back.</i>

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:12.970
Sorry, sorry!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.010
What did you do?

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:16.570
Oh, it's not... um...

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:18.640
<i>This isn't good. They're afraid of me.</i>

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.840
<i>You had a speck of dust on your shoulder!</i>

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:26.980
Y-You... dust.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:28.860
Piece of dust.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.660
Onoda-san is terrifying!

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.280
No!

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:38.550
You seem to be having fun, Onoda.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.950
T-Teshima-san...

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.220
Want to give it a try?

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:43.670
Huh? Try what?

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.800
Thed starter.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.090
Kinjou-san did it last year, remember?

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.380
Oh, I couldn't.

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:53.570
It's an important responsibility.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.020
That's the captain's job.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:56.720
Everyone's expecting great things from you.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.710
During these three weeks, rumors about 
you have spread among the first-years.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.420
I knew it.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.900
Do they think I'm weird?

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.320
You're the living legend 
of the first-year race.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:08.820
What?

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:12.610
You won the first-year race's 
mountain stage as a beginner

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.910
and rose to the level of the 
Inter-High in the blink of an eye.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:19.350
You're the man who won the general 
classification for Sohoku.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.370
You understand what it means 
for you to be the starter.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.270
Just so you know...

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:29.320
All the first-years ask 
are questions about you.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.690
What?

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:35.020
The first-years don't talk to 
you because you're too amazing.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.860
So only you can do it.

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:40.390
Raise their spirits.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.620
Show them how you feel.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.400
<i>How I feel...</i>

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.020
It's Onoda-san.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.570
Onoda-san is starting the race?

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.070
Everyone!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.240
Yes, sir!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.410
Do your best.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.890
Good luck.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:01.560
Yes, sir!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.460
Good luck.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:03.460
I'll do my very best!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.210
Good luck.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.490
Good luck.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:07.880
Thank you, Onoda-san.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.380
<i>He's got them really excited.</i>

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.630
<i>That idiot. It's already past time.</i>

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.930
<i>Did I even imagine that day...</i>

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:30.520
<i>That I would meet Kanzaki-san, 
Imaizumi-kun, and Naruko-kun?</i>

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.590
<i>That this race I participated in 
right after joining the club...</i>

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.450
<i>That first step</i>

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.190
<i>would lead me to such an expansive world?</i>

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.210
<i>So to all the first-years...</i>

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.000
The first-year welcoming race

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:50.340
will now begin!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.050
<i>Good luck.</i>

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.470
Sugimoto-kun?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.720
Teshima-san gave me permission 
to ride in the race.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:08.730
I'm going to take first and 
become Sohoku's sixth man.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.580
What?

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:15.900
Teshima-san, Sugimoto-kun is...

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:18.740
Yeah, I gave him permission.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.660
He said he was going to become the 
sixth man of the Inter-High team.

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:26.910
I saw that in his eyes.
That's why I gave him permission.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.340
<i>How could you not,
after seeing that serious face?</i>

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.690
Sugimoto's an interesting guy.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.820
Naturally, he must be aiming for first.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:38.590
That's what he said.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.620
Declaring he'll win a 
race against his juniors?

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.510
It may seem easy, but it's not.

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:49.140
But he must know that.
After all, he's an experienced rider.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.940
The city stage has a lot of traffic lights,
so we'll take it slow here.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:02.310
<i>My second first-year race has started.</i>

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.950
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:08.830
<i>I'm a second-year, too.
I'll show them what I can do.</i>

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.540
<i>I'll win my first race ever.</i>

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.150
<i>This is how I'll win.</i>

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:19.380
<i>My style favors long rides, so I'll take 
the lead partway through the race, and...</i>

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.380
Senpai!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.790
Don't you think we're going too slow?

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.810
Sawada, Gorizo...

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.230
I'll switch with you.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.170
Me, too.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.540
Wait! Go slower!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.310
We're still in the city!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:43.500
There's no passing until 
we reach the rice paddies!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.330
Didn't you see that signal? Stop!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:52.710
We saw it, but we're riding fast 
anyway to pull away from the pack.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.210
Senpai, don't you want to win, too?

00:19:58.070 --> 00:19:59.090
I...

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:03.090
The three of us can rotate 
until the finish line.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.300
No one's watching.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.710
Come on, Senpai.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.400
I desperately want to win.

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.800
But I reject your offer.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:27.930
No matter what, I never break the rules.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.040
Now reduce your speed 
and wait for the others.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:34.790
Sawada and Gorizo will be 
the first to make a move.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.000
But they're cunning.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.820
I hope Sugimoto doesn't 
accept any shady offers.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.260
Don't worry about him.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:46.010
He's more serious than he looks.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.770
Although whether or not he'll win 
is a different matter entirely.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:21:00.230
<i>Once we cross the bridge, 
the real race will start.</i>

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:02.240
What?

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:10.160
<i>The favorites in this race should 
be making their move now.</i>

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:14.290
I have a request.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.540
What is it?

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.420
I heard you hold a first-year race.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.560
Yeah.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.170
If Danchiku and I take first and second,

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:28.430
can you guarantee we'll 
be on the Inter-High team?

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.710
Sure, I promise.

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:33.930
You're on the team if you 
finish first and second.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.980
<i>Kaburagi and Danchiku...</i>

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.980
<i>They're fast!</i>

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:16.790
We're finally second-years.

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:20.250
I hope I can talk to the first-years.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:22.860
We're counting on you, Onoda-senpai.

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:27.800
L-Leave it to me, Naruko-senpai.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.480
What are guys doing? Hurry up and eat.

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:34.110
Sorry, Imaizumi-senpai.

00:23:35.270 --> 00:23:36.170
Okay.

00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:40.020
<i>NEXT RIDE The Sugimoto Brothers' Bond</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
